Third-party code in the page
----------------------------
None besides Octet Draw: the two npm packages Octet Draw's files import here (indigo-ketcher and @tauri-apps/api)
are replaced by the stand-ins above. Rebuilding the page needs the npm package esbuild (MIT), which is a build tool
and is not part of the page.
